          "id": "0:1783",
          "text": "Layout Breakpoints help you start working with Adaptive design in mind.  Setup your prefered layout using the properties panel and then detach the instance to get started.\n(press ‘shift’ + G to toggle Figma’s layout grid visibility)"
        },
